# Vendored official measure artifacts are hashed byte-for-byte by
# src/wiring/official-artifacts.test.ts (manifest.sha256). Git's text heuristic would CRLF-convert
# these NUL-free JSON files on a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true is the Git-for-Windows default),
# changing the digest and failing the integrity guard on a fresh clone while CI stays green.
measures/official/**/*.json -text
